{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54223","headline":"送崔致远西游将还（题拟） · 顾云","name":"送崔致远西游将还（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我闻海上三金鳌，金鳌头戴山高高。\n山之上兮，珠宫贝阙黄金殿；山之下兮，千里万里之洪涛。\n傍边一点鷄林碧，鳌山孕秀生奇特。\n十二乘船渡海来，文章感动中华国。\n十八横行战词苑，一箭射破金门策。\n（《三国史记》卷四六。\n《大正藏》第四九册《新刊贤首碑传正误》引「文章感动中华国」一句。\n）（按：《三国史记》引此诗爲节引。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}